xperiment_plan, all the listed entries are marked DONE, but the RUNNING ones only appear in the registry section. The user is probably referring to those active GPQA experiments since the worst-case scenario is entirely defined by GPQA behavior.\n\nI'm pulling together the specific experiments I need to analyze: the four currently running importance and random variants, plus the random experiments at s015, s025, and s030 that haven't started yet but are necessary for the ratio comparisons. I'll generate predictions for all of these with concrete numbers and clear reasoning, starting with the completed s015 data to establish the baseline patterns.\n\nLooking at the dose-response curve for the importance experiments across increasing sparsity levels, I'm seeing the median difference between low and high tiers start at 0.947 for s015, then grow to around 2.1 at s020, but the growth rate slows considerably at s025 and s030 as the effect plateaus. To capture the possibility of non-monotonic behavior in the worst case, I'm adjusting the s025 value slightly below s020 to reflect where the correlation might dip below perfect monotonicity. Looking at the s025 and s030 values, I'm seeing that at extreme sparsity levels, both phases degrade similarly due to numerical instability and floor effects, which compresses the difference between them. So I'll set s025 at 2.5 and s030 at 2.0 to capture this non-monotonic behavior while staying within plausible bounds. Now I'm calculating the Spearman correlation for this sequence against the rank ordering. I'm setting the random baseline values for GPQA across the scale points, then calculating the importance-to-random ratios to verify they stay below the 1.5× threshold—all four ratios cluster tightly between 1.25× and 1.39×, confirming this worst-case scenario is internally consistent.\n\nNow I'm computing the effect sizes by dividing median differences by the standard deviation of paired differences, which gives me d_z values around 0.55-0.65 for random and 0.7-0.8 for importance at s020, both crossing the 0.5 threshold needed for statistical significance.\n\nGenerating YAML output...","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":59092,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":59092},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"175b1f5d-2385-49b8-8bc0-0b39bb9f6581","uuid":"63bb3a97-32cc-4ce1-ac41-9847105a29c0"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01E59WoCXbaXaQMs27i5RC5w","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: \"核心叙事从 'strategy-specific phase interaction' 重构为 'universal phase vulnerability in compound sparsity'。GPQA 数据显示 random eviction 产生与 importance 可比拟的 phase gradient (ratio <1.5×)，且 importance gradient 在 s025→s030 出现 non-monotonicity。Strategy specificity 仅在 MATH-500 DeepSeek 上强 (15-17×)，其余条件均 ≤3×。新 angle: phase vulnerability universality 本身是 novel characterization；recency 作为唯一 phase-robust strategy 的 practical implication；discrimination collapse 解释 importance≥random 的微弱优势。\"\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"gpqa_ds_importance_s020\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_importance_s020\"\n    description: \"GPQA importance masking s=0.20, DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B, n=198\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      high_median_ii: 0.035\n      mid_median_ii: 0.28\n      low_median_ii: 1.85\n      median_diff_low_minus_high: 1.815\n      wilcoxon_p: 2.5e-28\n      cohens_dz: 0.72\n      ci_low: 1.52\n      ci_high: 2.18\n      monotonic: true\n      phase_gradient_direction: \"low > mid > high\"\n      median_ratio_low_high: 52.9\n    result_rationale: \"GPQA 问题的推理链平均 ~6000 tokens (远长于 MATH-500 ~1200)，导致 low-sparsity phase 中可被 evict 的 critical token 绝对数量远多于 MATH-500。s020 compound interaction 在 GPQA 上产生 median_diff ~1.8，虽然方向与 MATH-500 一致 (MATH-500 s020=1.21)，但增长率从 MATH-500 的 s015→s020 3.1× 压缩为 GPQA 的 1.9×。原因：GPQA 多学科内容 (physics/chem/bio) 的 attention pattern 比纯数学推理更分散，head pruning 后的 discrimination collapse 在 s015 时已较充分——进一步增加 sparsity 的边际 collapse 效应递减。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"GPQA DS Importance s020 Phase II\"\n        columns: [\"phase\", \"n_segments\", \"ii_median\", \"ii_mean\", \"ii_ci_low\", \"ii_ci_high\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"high\", 6261, 0.035, 0.42, 0.12, 0.95]\n          - [\"mid\", 2185, 0.28, 1.95, 1.45, 2.62]\n          - [\"low\", 5128, 1.85, 12.8, 10.2, 15.9]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Phase gradient bar chart: 三 phase II median 值递增但绝对量级弱于 MATH-500 同 sparsity (MATH 1.50 vs GPQA 1.85 — 仅 1.23× 而非预期 ~3×)\"\n    analysis: \"虽然 monotonic 且显著，但 median_diff 仅 1.82，低于 MATH-500 同 sparsity 的 1.48 × 3(GPQA序列长度比) 的预期。暗示 GPQA 上 phase gradient 的 scaling behavior 不同于 MATH-500。\"\n\n  - name: \"gpqa_ds_importance_s025\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_importance_s025\"\n    description: \"GPQA importance masking s=0.25, DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B, n=198\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      high_median_ii: 0.082\n      mid_median_ii: 0.65\n      low_median_ii: 2.58\n      median_diff_low_minus_high: 2.498\n      wilcoxon_p: 8.1e-32\n      cohens_dz: 0.81\n      ci_low: 2.05\n      ci_high: 3.12\n      monotonic: true\n      phase_gradient_direction: \"low > mid > high\"\n      dose_response_rho_s015_to_s025: 1.0\n      growth_factor_vs_s020: 1.38\n    result_rationale: \"s025 在 GPQA 上仍保持 monotonic，但增长率急剧放缓 (s020→s025 仅 1.38× vs MATH-500 同区间 3.3×)。机制：GPQA 问题在 s025 compound sparsity 下，模型的 reasoning pathway 开始崩溃——不再尝试深度推理而转为浅层 pattern matching。这导致 low-sparsity phase 的 'reasoning content' 本身变少 (模型生成更短的 CoT)，压缩了 phase 间的 II 差异。同时 high-sparsity phase 的 II 也在上升 (0.013→0.035→0.082)，表明 compound interaction 开始渗透到 answer phase。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"GPQA DS Importance s025 Phase II\"\n        columns: [\"phase\", \"n_segments\", \"ii_median\", \"ii_mean\", \"ii_ci_low\", \"ii_ci_high\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"high\", 6261, 0.082, 0.98, 0.45, 1.72]\n          - [\"mid\", 2185, 0.65, 4.8, 3.2, 6.9]\n          - [\"low\", 5128, 2.58, 28.5, 21.3, 37.8]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Dose-response curve (GPQA): s015→s020→s025 median_diff = 0.95, 1.82, 2.50 — 曲线明显 concave (增长率递减) vs MATH-500 的 convex 加速增长\"\n    analysis: \"关键信号：GPQA gradient 增长 sub-linear 且远弱于 MATH-500。如果 s030 继续减速或反转，将确认 non-monotonicity。\"\n\n  - name: \"gpqa_ds_importance_s030\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_importance_s030\"\n    description: \"GPQA importance masking s=0.30, DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B, n=198\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      high_median_ii: 0.155\n      mid_median_ii: 0.82\n      low_median_ii: 2.12\n      median_diff_low_minus_high: 1.965\n      wilcoxon_p: 3.7e-25\n      cohens_dz: 0.62\n      ci_low: 1.42\n      ci_high: 2.68\n      monotonic: true\n      phase_gradient_direction: \"low > mid > high\"\n      dose_response_rho_full: 0.8\n      growth_factor_vs_s025: 0.79\n      non_monotonic: true\n      non_monotonic_note: \"median_diff DECREASES from s025 (2.50) to s030 (1.97) — gradient SHRINKS at extreme sparsity\"\n    result_rationale: \"Non-monotonicity 的机制：s030 extreme compound sparsity 导致 GPQA 上 BOTH phases 的 perplexity 飙升至 catastrophic level (both_ppl > 200 在 low phase)。此时 low-sparsity phase 的 II 增长遇到 ceiling effect (模型输出接近 random tokens，II 计算中的 ppl_both 分子/分母同时爆炸导致 ratio 压缩)，而 high-sparsity phase 的 II 继续上升 (因为 answer phase 也开始严重受损)。净效果：phase 间差异反而缩小。这与 recency s030 的 numerical instability 观察一致 (D102)，表明 extreme sparsity 下 phase gradient 本身变得 unreliable。GPQA 比 MATH-500 更早触及此 ceiling 因为其 baseline perplexity 更高 (dense low-phase ppl 1.42 vs MATH 1.23)。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"GPQA DS Importance Dose-Response (Worst Tier)\"\n        columns: [\"sparsity\", \"median_diff\", \"growth_factor\", \"cohens_dz\", \"monotonic\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"s015\", 0.947, \"-\", 0.68, true]\n          - [\"s020\", 1.815, \"1.92×\", 0.72, true]\n          - [\"s025\", 2.498, \"1.38×\", 0.81, true]\n          - [\"s030\", 1.965, \"0.79×\", 0.62, \"NON-MONOTONIC (reversal)\"]\n      - name: \"Spearman ρ comparison across benchmarks\"\n        columns: [\"benchmark\", \"model\", \"dose_response_rho\", \"note\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MATH-500\", \"DeepSeek\", 1.0, \"perfect monotonic\"]\n          - [\"MATH-500\", \"Qwen\", 1.0, \"perfect monotonic\"]\n          - [\"GSM8K\", \"DeepSeek\", 1.0, \"perfect monotonic\"]\n          - [\"GSM8K\", \"Qwen\", 1.0, \"perfect monotonic\"]\n          - [\"GPQA\", \"DeepSeek\", 0.8, \"NON-MONOTONIC at s030\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Four-panel dose-response: MATH-500 convex acceleration vs GPQA concave deceleration + reversal at s030。视觉上 GPQA curve 'rolls over' 而非持续上升\"\n      - \"Phase II heatmap (sparsity × phase): GPQA s030 的 high-phase II 显著升高 (0.155 vs s015 的 0.013)，表明 compound damage 向 answer phase 扩散\"\n    analysis: \"这是 worst tier 的核心证据：GPQA importance gradient 在 s030 出现 non-monotonicity (ρ=0.8)，直接否定了 'monotonic dose-response' 作为 universal property。解释为 ceiling effect + catastrophic collapse——strategy specificity 的前提 (importance gradient 远强于 random) 在 extreme GPQA compound 条件下不成立。\"\n\n  - name: \"gpqa_ds_random_s020\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_random_s020\"\n    description: \"GPQA random masking s=0.20, DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B, n=198\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      high_median_ii: 0.028\n      mid_median_ii: 0.35\n      low_median_ii: 1.42\n      median_diff_low_minus_high: 1.392\n      wilcoxon_p: 5.2e-22\n      cohens_dz: 0.58\n      ci_low: 1.05\n      ci_high: 1.82\n      monotonic: true\n      phase_gradient_significant: true\n      imp_rand_ratio_s020: 1.30\n    result_rationale: \"GPQA random eviction 在 s020 产生显著 phase gradient (d_z=0.58 > 0.5 threshold)，与 MATH-500 s020 random 的 NS 结果 (median_diff=-0.016, FAIL) 形成鲜明对比。机制：GPQA 推理链极长 (~6000 tokens)，low-sparsity phase 占据大量序列位置。Random eviction 在长序列上有更高概率命中关键 reasoning token——这是一个纯粹的 combinatorial effect (更长序列 = 更多 critical tokens = 随机删除更可能破坏推理链)，与 importance score 的 discriminability 无关。换言之，GPQA 的 phase gradient 主要由 'phase duration asymmetry × random hit probability' 驱动，而非 strategy-specific discrimination collapse。imp/rand ratio 仅 1.30× 表明 importance 相比 random 几乎没有额外的 phase-specific damage——所谓 'strategy specificity' 在 GPQA 上 collapse。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"GPQA Random s020 vs Importance s020\"\n        columns: [\"strategy\", \"high_median\", \"low_median\", \"median_diff\", \"dz\", \"p\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"importance\", 0.035, 1.85, 1.815, 0.72, \"2.5e-28\"]\n          - [\"random\", 0.028, 1.42, 1.392, 0.58, \"5.2e-22\"]\n          - [\"ratio (imp/rand)\", \"-\", \"-\", \"1.30×\", \"1.24×\", \"-\"]\n      - name: \"Strategy Specificity Cross-Benchmark Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"benchmark\", \"model\", \"sparsity\", \"imp/rand_ratio\", \"interpretation\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MATH-500\", \"DeepSeek\", \"s025\", \"15.5×\", \"strong specificity\"]\n          - [\"MATH-500\", \"DeepSeek\", \"s030\", \"16.6×\", \"strong specificity\"]\n          - [\"MATH-500\", \"Qwen (n=500)\", \"s025\", \"2.7×\", \"weak specificity\"]\n          - [\"GSM8K\", \"DeepSeek\", \"s025\", \"3.8×\", \"moderate\"]\n          - [\"GSM8K\", \"DeepSeek\", \"s030\", \"2.8×\", \"weak\"]\n          - [\"GPQA\", \"DeepSeek\", \"s020\", \"1.30×\", \"NO specificity\"]\n          - [\"LLaMA\", \"LLaMA-8B\", \"s025\", \"2.0×\", \"weak\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Paired comparison: GPQA importance vs random phase gradient 几乎重叠 (ratio 1.3×)，视觉上无法区分——与 MATH-500 DeepSeek 的 clear separation (15×) 形成 stark contrast\"\n      - \"Cross-benchmark strategy specificity heatmap: 仅 MATH-500 DeepSeek 一个 cell 显示强 specificity (>10×)，其余 5/6 条件均 ≤3.8×\"\n    analysis: \"GPQA random 的强 phase gradient 确认：phase vulnerability 是 compound sparsity 的 intrinsic property (universal)，不是 importance strategy 的 specific behavior。核心叙事必须重构。\"\n\n  - name: \"gpqa_ds_random_s015\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_random_s015_planned\"\n    description: \"GPQA random masking s=0.15, DeepSeek (needed for complete ratio comparison)\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      high_median_ii: 0.015\n      mid_median_ii: 0.18\n      low_median_ii: 0.72\n      median_diff_low_minus_high: 0.705\n      wilcoxon_p: 8.3e-16\n      cohens_dz: 0.52\n      ci_low: 0.48\n      ci_high: 0.95\n      monotonic: true\n      phase_gradient_significant: true\n      imp_rand_ratio_s015: 1.34\n    result_rationale: \"即使在低 sparsity s015，GPQA random 已显示显著 phase gradient (d_z=0.52)。对比 MATH-500 s015 random 完全 NS (median_diff=0.0095, FAIL)。原因同上：GPQA 序列长度导致 random eviction 的 combinatorial hit probability 在 low-sparsity reasoning phase 远高于 MATH-500。imp/rand ratio 1.34× 表明在所有 GPQA sparsity level 上 strategy specificity 都不成立。\"\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"GPQA random dose-response: s015=0.71, s020=1.39 — 本身已是 monotonic increasing，且与 importance 几乎平行增长\"\n    analysis: \"与 MATH-500 random s015 NS 的 qualitative difference 确认 phase gradient universality 是 task/sequence-length dependent 而非 strategy-specific。\"\n\n  - name: \"gpqa_ds_random_s025\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_random_s025_planned\"\n    description: \"GPQA random masking s=0.25, DeepSeek (needed for full dose-response)\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      high_median_ii: 0.065\n      mid_median_ii: 0.72\n      low_median_ii: 1.95\n      median_diff_low_minus_high: 1.885\n      wilcoxon_p: 1.1e-26\n      cohens_dz: 0.62\n      ci_low: 1.48\n      ci_high: 2.35\n      monotonic: true\n      imp_rand_ratio_s025: 1.33\n    result_rationale: \"Random s025 的 median_diff (1.89) 甚至接近 importance s025 (2.50)。ratio 仅 1.33×。在 MATH-500 s025 上 imp/rand ratio 是 15.5× (DS n=500)。这一 ~12× 的 ratio 衰减 (15.5→1.33) 彻底瓦解了 strategy specificity 作为 general finding 的地位。机制：GPQA 问题的 attention score landscape 在 s025 compound 条件下已极度 flat (discrimination collapse 更彻底)，导致 importance eviction 退化为 quasi-random——两种 strategy 在行为上趋同。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"GPQA Dose-Response: Importance vs Random\"\n        columns: [\"sparsity\", \"imp_median_diff\", \"rand_median_diff\", \"ratio\", \"MATH500_ratio\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"s015\", 0.947, 0.705, \"1.34×\", \"28.1× (NS)\"]\n          - [\"s020\", 1.815, 1.392, \"1.30×\", \"38.6× (NS)\"]\n          - [\"s025\", 2.498, 1.885, \"1.33×\", \"15.5×\"]\n          - [\"s030\", 1.965, 1.620, \"1.21×\", \"16.6×\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"双轴 ribbon plot: importance 和 random 的 phase gradient 在 GPQA 上近乎重叠 (narrow ribbon)，在 MATH-500 上大幅分离 (wide ribbon)\"\n    analysis: \"Strategy specificity 在 GPQA 全 4 个 sparsity 上均 <1.5×。这是 worst tier 的 decisive evidence。\"\n\n  - name: \"gpqa_ds_random_s030\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_random_s030_planned\"\n    description: \"GPQA random masking s=0.30, DeepSeek (needed for full picture)\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      high_median_ii: 0.12\n      mid_median_ii: 0.85\n      low_median_ii: 1.74\n      median_diff_low_minus_high: 1.620\n      wilcoxon_p: 7.8e-20\n      cohens_dz: 0.53\n      ci_low: 1.15\n      ci_high: 2.18\n      monotonic: true\n      imp_rand_ratio_s030: 1.21\n      random_also_non_monotonic: true\n      random_rho: 0.8\n    result_rationale: \"Random 在 s030 同样出现增长放缓 (s025 1.89 → s030 1.62, growth factor 0.86×)，与 importance 的 non-monotonicity 平行。这进一步确认：non-monotonicity 不是 importance-specific behavior 而是 GPQA + extreme sparsity 的 ceiling/collapse effect。两种 strategy 的 phase gradient 同步衰减表明驱动因素是 task-level 的 (reasoning chain 在 extreme compound sparsity 下崩溃导致 phase structure 本身消失)，而非 strategy-level 的。imp/rand ratio 在 s030 降至最低 (1.21×)——strategy 完全不可区分。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"GPQA Random Full Dose-Response\"\n        columns: [\"sparsity\", \"median_diff\", \"dz\", \"p\", \"monotonic_cumulative\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"s015\", 0.705, 0.52, \"8.3e-16\", \"yes\"]\n          - [\"s020\", 1.392, 0.58, \"5.2e-22\", \"yes\"]\n          - [\"s025\", 1.885, 0.62, \"1.1e-26\", \"yes\"]\n          - [\"s030\", 1.620, 0.53, \"7.8e-20\", \"NON-MONOTONIC (peak at s025)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Overlay plot: GPQA importance 和 random dose-response 曲线几乎完全重合，两者都在 s025 reach peak 后在 s030 回落\"\n    analysis: \"Random 和 importance 的 parallel non-monotonicity 是 worst tier 最强证据——任何基于 'strategy-specific' 的 narrative 都无法解释为什么两种完全不同的 eviction 方法产生相同的 dose-response shape。\"\n\n  - name: \"cross_benchmark_strategy_specificity_synthesis\"\n    plan_id: \"synthesis_analysis\"\n    description: \"综合分析：跨 4 benchmarks × 3 models 的 strategy specificity 汇总\"\n    expected_results:\n      conditions_with_strong_specificity: 1  # only MATH-500 DeepSeek\n      conditions_with_moderate_specificity: 1  # GSM8K DeepSeek s025\n      conditions_with_weak_or_no_specificity: 5  # GSM8K rest, GPQA all, LLaMA all\n      cross_benchmark_gradient_correlation: 0.72\n      strategy_specificity_fraction: \"1/7 (14%)\"\n      expected_reviewer_avg_score: 2.8\n      novelty_score: 2.7\n    result_rationale: \"汇总所有条件后，'strategy-specific phase interaction' 仅在单一条件 (MATH-500 DeepSeek, 15-17×) 成立。其余 6/7 条件的 imp/rand ratio 均 ≤3.8×，其中 GPQA 全部 <1.5×。Reviewers 会合理质疑：如果核心 claim 仅在一个 (model, benchmark) pair 上强，这是 robust finding 还是 idiosyncratic artifact？cross_benchmark_gradient_correlation 0.72 表明 phase gradient 本身跨 benchmark 存在 (moderate correlation)，但 strategy modulation 不 generalizable。预期 reviewer scores: Novelty 2.7 (phase gradient universality 有一定新意但被视为 'obvious once you measure it')，Soundness 3.0 (统计严格)，Significance 2.5 (practical impact unclear without method paper)，Overall 2.8。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Strategy Specificity Summary (All Conditions)\"\n        columns: [\"benchmark\", \"model\", \"best_sparsity_ratio\", \"classification\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MATH-500\", \"DeepSeek-7B\", \"15.5-16.6×\", \"STRONG\"]\n          - [\"MATH-500\", \"Qwen-7B (n=500)\", \"2.7×\", \"WEAK\"]\n          - [\"MATH-500\", \"LLaMA-8B (n=250)\", \"2.0-2.6×\", \"WEAK\"]\n          - [\"GSM8K\", \"DeepSeek-7B\", \"2.3-3.8×\", \"MODERATE-WEAK\"]\n          - [\"GSM8K\", \"Qwen-7B\", \"~2.5×\", \"WEAK\"]\n          - [\"GPQA\", \"DeepSeek-7B\", \"1.2-1.3×\", \"NONE\"]\n      - name: \"Revised Paper Claim Structure (Worst Tier)\"\n        columns: [\"claim\", \"status_revision\", \"note\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Phase gradient universality\", \"PRIMARY (upgraded)\", \"All strategies (except recency) show phase gradient on all benchmarks\"]\n          - [\"Strategy specificity\", \"SECONDARY (downgraded)\", \"Only MATH-500 DeepSeek; task/architecture dependent\"]\n          - [\"Recency as phase-robust control\", \"PRIMARY (retained)\", \"Still unique: only strategy with NS across all sparsities\"]\n          - [\"Discrimination collapse\", \"MECHANISM (retained)\", \"Explains why importance ≥ random even when ratio small\"]\n          - [\"Dose-response monotonicity\", \"QUALIFIED\", \"Holds for MATH-500/GSM8K; non-monotonic on GPQA at extreme sparsity\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Strategy specificity heatmap (benchmark × model): 颜色编码 imp/rand ratio。仅左上角一个 cell (MATH-500/DS) 为深色 (>10×)，其余浅色 (<4×)。GPQA row 全为最浅色 (<1.5×)\"\n      - \"Reframed narrative diagram: 'universal phase vulnerability' 为中心节点，'strategy modulation' 为弱 secondary edge，'recency immunity' 为 key exception\"\n    analysis: \"在 worst tier 下，论文需要完全重构。核心贡献变为：(1) 首次量化 compound sparsity 的 phase vulnerability 是 universal property (所有 non-recency strategy 在所有 benchmark 上均显示)，(2) recency 作为唯一 immune strategy 的 practical design implication，(3) strategy specificity 作为 task/architecture-dependent secondary phenomenon。Reviewer 预期反应：'interesting empirical observation but incremental—once you measure phase gradient for random you see it's not strategy-specific, so the whole discrimination collapse story becomes auxiliary rather than central。' Expected score ~2.8, borderline for EMNLP。需要加强 practical implication (e.g., phase-aware compression guideline) 来弥补 novelty 不足。\"\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":59092,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":59092},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"175b1f5d-2385-49b8-8bc0-0b39bb9f6581","uuid":"e8ef9b7c-6d80-4f80-b3dc-9d6a8874d688"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":217298,"duration_api_ms":219392,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: \"核心叙事从 'strategy-specific phase interaction' 重构为 'universal phase vulnerability in compound sparsity'。GPQA 数据显示 random eviction 产生与 importance 可比拟的 phase gradient (ratio <1.5×)，且 importance gradient 在 s025→s030 出现 non-monotonicity。Strategy specificity 仅在 MATH-500 DeepSeek 上强 (15-17×)，其余条件均 ≤3×。新 angle: phase vulnerability universality 本身是 novel characterization；recency 作为唯一 phase-robust strategy 的 practical implication；discrimination collapse 解释 importance≥random 的微弱优势。\"\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"gpqa_ds_importance_s020\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_importance_s020\"\n    description: \"GPQA importance masking s=0.20, DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B, n=198\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      high_median_ii: 0.035\n      mid_median_ii: 0.28\n      low_median_ii: 1.85\n      median_diff_low_minus_high: 1.815\n      wilcoxon_p: 2.5e-28\n      cohens_dz: 0.72\n      ci_low: 1.52\n      ci_high: 2.18\n      monotonic: true\n      phase_gradient_direction: \"low > mid > high\"\n      median_ratio_low_high: 52.9\n    result_rationale: \"GPQA 问题的推理链平均 ~6000 tokens (远长于 MATH-500 ~1200)，导致 low-sparsity phase 中可被 evict 的 critical token 绝对数量远多于 MATH-500。s020 compound interaction 在 GPQA 上产生 median_diff ~1.8，虽然方向与 MATH-500 一致 (MATH-500 s020=1.21)，但增长率从 MATH-500 的 s015→s020 3.1× 压缩为 GPQA 的 1.9×。原因：GPQA 多学科内容 (physics/chem/bio) 的 attention pattern 比纯数学推理更分散，head pruning 后的 discrimination collapse 在 s015 时已较充分——进一步增加 sparsity 的边际 collapse 效应递减。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"GPQA DS Importance s020 Phase II\"\n        columns: [\"phase\", \"n_segments\", \"ii_median\", \"ii_mean\", \"ii_ci_low\", \"ii_ci_high\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"high\", 6261, 0.035, 0.42, 0.12, 0.95]\n          - [\"mid\", 2185, 0.28, 1.95, 1.45, 2.62]\n          - [\"low\", 5128, 1.85, 12.8, 10.2, 15.9]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Phase gradient bar chart: 三 phase II median 值递增但绝对量级弱于 MATH-500 同 sparsity (MATH 1.50 vs GPQA 1.85 — 仅 1.23× 而非预期 ~3×)\"\n    analysis: \"虽然 monotonic 且显著，但 median_diff 仅 1.82，低于 MATH-500 同 sparsity 的 1.48 × 3(GPQA序列长度比) 的预期。暗示 GPQA 上 phase gradient 的 scaling behavior 不同于 MATH-500。\"\n\n  - name: \"gpqa_ds_importance_s025\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_importance_s025\"\n    description: \"GPQA importance masking s=0.25, DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B, n=198\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      high_median_ii: 0.082\n      mid_median_ii: 0.65\n      low_median_ii: 2.58\n      median_diff_low_minus_high: 2.498\n      wilcoxon_p: 8.1e-32\n      cohens_dz: 0.81\n      ci_low: 2.05\n      ci_high: 3.12\n      monotonic: true\n      phase_gradient_direction: \"low > mid > high\"\n      dose_response_rho_s015_to_s025: 1.0\n      growth_factor_vs_s020: 1.38\n    result_rationale: \"s025 在 GPQA 上仍保持 monotonic，但增长率急剧放缓 (s020→s025 仅 1.38× vs MATH-500 同区间 3.3×)。机制：GPQA 问题在 s025 compound sparsity 下，模型的 reasoning pathway 开始崩溃——不再尝试深度推理而转为浅层 pattern matching。这导致 low-sparsity phase 的 'reasoning content' 本身变少 (模型生成更短的 CoT)，压缩了 phase 间的 II 差异。同时 high-sparsity phase 的 II 也在上升 (0.013→0.035→0.082)，表明 compound interaction 开始渗透到 answer phase。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"GPQA DS Importance s025 Phase II\"\n        columns: [\"phase\", \"n_segments\", \"ii_median\", \"ii_mean\", \"ii_ci_low\", \"ii_ci_high\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"high\", 6261, 0.082, 0.98, 0.45, 1.72]\n          - [\"mid\", 2185, 0.65, 4.8, 3.2, 6.9]\n          - [\"low\", 5128, 2.58, 28.5, 21.3, 37.8]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Dose-response curve (GPQA): s015→s020→s025 median_diff = 0.95, 1.82, 2.50 — 曲线明显 concave (增长率递减) vs MATH-500 的 convex 加速增长\"\n    analysis: \"关键信号：GPQA gradient 增长 sub-linear 且远弱于 MATH-500。如果 s030 继续减速或反转，将确认 non-monotonicity。\"\n\n  - name: \"gpqa_ds_importance_s030\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_importance_s030\"\n    description: \"GPQA importance masking s=0.30, DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B, n=198\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      high_median_ii: 0.155\n      mid_median_ii: 0.82\n      low_median_ii: 2.12\n      median_diff_low_minus_high: 1.965\n      wilcoxon_p: 3.7e-25\n      cohens_dz: 0.62\n      ci_low: 1.42\n      ci_high: 2.68\n      monotonic: true\n      phase_gradient_direction: \"low > mid > high\"\n      dose_response_rho_full: 0.8\n      growth_factor_vs_s025: 0.79\n      non_monotonic: true\n      non_monotonic_note: \"median_diff DECREASES from s025 (2.50) to s030 (1.97) — gradient SHRINKS at extreme sparsity\"\n    result_rationale: \"Non-monotonicity 的机制：s030 extreme compound sparsity 导致 GPQA 上 BOTH phases 的 perplexity 飙升至 catastrophic level (both_ppl > 200 在 low phase)。此时 low-sparsity phase 的 II 增长遇到 ceiling effect (模型输出接近 random tokens，II 计算中的 ppl_both 分子/分母同时爆炸导致 ratio 压缩)，而 high-sparsity phase 的 II 继续上升 (因为 answer phase 也开始严重受损)。净效果：phase 间差异反而缩小。这与 recency s030 的 numerical instability 观察一致 (D102)，表明 extreme sparsity 下 phase gradient 本身变得 unreliable。GPQA 比 MATH-500 更早触及此 ceiling 因为其 baseline perplexity 更高 (dense low-phase ppl 1.42 vs MATH 1.23)。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"GPQA DS Importance Dose-Response (Worst Tier)\"\n        columns: [\"sparsity\", \"median_diff\", \"growth_factor\", \"cohens_dz\", \"monotonic\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"s015\", 0.947, \"-\", 0.68, true]\n          - [\"s020\", 1.815, \"1.92×\", 0.72, true]\n          - [\"s025\", 2.498, \"1.38×\", 0.81, true]\n          - [\"s030\", 1.965, \"0.79×\", 0.62, \"NON-MONOTONIC (reversal)\"]\n      - name: \"Spearman ρ comparison across benchmarks\"\n        columns: [\"benchmark\", \"model\", \"dose_response_rho\", \"note\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MATH-500\", \"DeepSeek\", 1.0, \"perfect monotonic\"]\n          - [\"MATH-500\", \"Qwen\", 1.0, \"perfect monotonic\"]\n          - [\"GSM8K\", \"DeepSeek\", 1.0, \"perfect monotonic\"]\n          - [\"GSM8K\", \"Qwen\", 1.0, \"perfect monotonic\"]\n          - [\"GPQA\", \"DeepSeek\", 0.8, \"NON-MONOTONIC at s030\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Four-panel dose-response: MATH-500 convex acceleration vs GPQA concave deceleration + reversal at s030。视觉上 GPQA curve 'rolls over' 而非持续上升\"\n      - \"Phase II heatmap (sparsity × phase): GPQA s030 的 high-phase II 显著升高 (0.155 vs s015 的 0.013)，表明 compound damage 向 answer phase 扩散\"\n    analysis: \"这是 worst tier 的核心证据：GPQA importance gradient 在 s030 出现 non-monotonicity (ρ=0.8)，直接否定了 'monotonic dose-response' 作为 universal property。解释为 ceiling effect + catastrophic collapse——strategy specificity 的前提 (importance gradient 远强于 random) 在 extreme GPQA compound 条件下不成立。\"\n\n  - name: \"gpqa_ds_random_s020\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_random_s020\"\n    description: \"GPQA random masking s=0.20, DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B, n=198\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      high_median_ii: 0.028\n      mid_median_ii: 0.35\n      low_median_ii: 1.42\n      median_diff_low_minus_high: 1.392\n      wilcoxon_p: 5.2e-22\n      cohens_dz: 0.58\n      ci_low: 1.05\n      ci_high: 1.82\n      monotonic: true\n      phase_gradient_significant: true\n      imp_rand_ratio_s020: 1.30\n    result_rationale: \"GPQA random eviction 在 s020 产生显著 phase gradient (d_z=0.58 > 0.5 threshold)，与 MATH-500 s020 random 的 NS 结果 (median_diff=-0.016, FAIL) 形成鲜明对比。机制：GPQA 推理链极长 (~6000 tokens)，low-sparsity phase 占据大量序列位置。Random eviction 在长序列上有更高概率命中关键 reasoning token——这是一个纯粹的 combinatorial effect (更长序列 = 更多 critical tokens = 随机删除更可能破坏推理链)，与 importance score 的 discriminability 无关。换言之，GPQA 的 phase gradient 主要由 'phase duration asymmetry × random hit probability' 驱动，而非 strategy-specific discrimination collapse。imp/rand ratio 仅 1.30× 表明 importance 相比 random 几乎没有额外的 phase-specific damage——所谓 'strategy specificity' 在 GPQA 上 collapse。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"GPQA Random s020 vs Importance s020\"\n        columns: [\"strategy\", \"high_median\", \"low_median\", \"median_diff\", \"dz\", \"p\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"importance\", 0.035, 1.85, 1.815, 0.72, \"2.5e-28\"]\n          - [\"random\", 0.028, 1.42, 1.392, 0.58, \"5.2e-22\"]\n          - [\"ratio (imp/rand)\", \"-\", \"-\", \"1.30×\", \"1.24×\", \"-\"]\n      - name: \"Strategy Specificity Cross-Benchmark Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"benchmark\", \"model\", \"sparsity\", \"imp/rand_ratio\", \"interpretation\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MATH-500\", \"DeepSeek\", \"s025\", \"15.5×\", \"strong specificity\"]\n          - [\"MATH-500\", \"DeepSeek\", \"s030\", \"16.6×\", \"strong specificity\"]\n          - [\"MATH-500\", \"Qwen (n=500)\", \"s025\", \"2.7×\", \"weak specificity\"]\n          - [\"GSM8K\", \"DeepSeek\", \"s025\", \"3.8×\", \"moderate\"]\n          - [\"GSM8K\", \"DeepSeek\", \"s030\", \"2.8×\", \"weak\"]\n          - [\"GPQA\", \"DeepSeek\", \"s020\", \"1.30×\", \"NO specificity\"]\n          - [\"LLaMA\", \"LLaMA-8B\", \"s025\", \"2.0×\", \"weak\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Paired comparison: GPQA importance vs random phase gradient 几乎重叠 (ratio 1.3×)，视觉上无法区分——与 MATH-500 DeepSeek 的 clear separation (15×) 形成 stark contrast\"\n      - \"Cross-benchmark strategy specificity heatmap: 仅 MATH-500 DeepSeek 一个 cell 显示强 specificity (>10×)，其余 5/6 条件均 ≤3.8×\"\n    analysis: \"GPQA random 的强 phase gradient 确认：phase vulnerability 是 compound sparsity 的 intrinsic property (universal)，不是 importance strategy 的 specific behavior。核心叙事必须重构。\"\n\n  - name: \"gpqa_ds_random_s015\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_random_s015_planned\"\n    description: \"GPQA random masking s=0.15, DeepSeek (needed for complete ratio comparison)\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      high_median_ii: 0.015\n      mid_median_ii: 0.18\n      low_median_ii: 0.72\n      median_diff_low_minus_high: 0.705\n      wilcoxon_p: 8.3e-16\n      cohens_dz: 0.52\n      ci_low: 0.48\n      ci_high: 0.95\n      monotonic: true\n      phase_gradient_significant: true\n      imp_rand_ratio_s015: 1.34\n    result_rationale: \"即使在低 sparsity s015，GPQA random 已显示显著 phase gradient (d_z=0.52)。对比 MATH-500 s015 random 完全 NS (median_diff=0.0095, FAIL)。原因同上：GPQA 序列长度导致 random eviction 的 combinatorial hit probability 在 low-sparsity reasoning phase 远高于 MATH-500。imp/rand ratio 1.34× 表明在所有 GPQA sparsity level 上 strategy specificity 都不成立。\"\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"GPQA random dose-response: s015=0.71, s020=1.39 — 本身已是 monotonic increasing，且与 importance 几乎平行增长\"\n    analysis: \"与 MATH-500 random s015 NS 的 qualitative difference 确认 phase gradient universality 是 task/sequence-length dependent 而非 strategy-specific。\"\n\n  - name: \"gpqa_ds_random_s025\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_random_s025_planned\"\n    description: \"GPQA random masking s=0.25, DeepSeek (needed for full dose-response)\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      high_median_ii: 0.065\n      mid_median_ii: 0.72\n      low_median_ii: 1.95\n      median_diff_low_minus_high: 1.885\n      wilcoxon_p: 1.1e-26\n      cohens_dz: 0.62\n      ci_low: 1.48\n      ci_high: 2.35\n      monotonic: true\n      imp_rand_ratio_s025: 1.33\n    result_rationale: \"Random s025 的 median_diff (1.89) 甚至接近 importance s025 (2.50)。ratio 仅 1.33×。在 MATH-500 s025 上 imp/rand ratio 是 15.5× (DS n=500)。这一 ~12× 的 ratio 衰减 (15.5→1.33) 彻底瓦解了 strategy specificity 作为 general finding 的地位。机制：GPQA 问题的 attention score landscape 在 s025 compound 条件下已极度 flat (discrimination collapse 更彻底)，导致 importance eviction 退化为 quasi-random——两种 strategy 在行为上趋同。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"GPQA Dose-Response: Importance vs Random\"\n        columns: [\"sparsity\", \"imp_median_diff\", \"rand_median_diff\", \"ratio\", \"MATH500_ratio\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"s015\", 0.947, 0.705, \"1.34×\", \"28.1× (NS)\"]\n          - [\"s020\", 1.815, 1.392, \"1.30×\", \"38.6× (NS)\"]\n          - [\"s025\", 2.498, 1.885, \"1.33×\", \"15.5×\"]\n          - [\"s030\", 1.965, 1.620, \"1.21×\", \"16.6×\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"双轴 ribbon plot: importance 和 random 的 phase gradient 在 GPQA 上近乎重叠 (narrow ribbon)，在 MATH-500 上大幅分离 (wide ribbon)\"\n    analysis: \"Strategy specificity 在 GPQA 全 4 个 sparsity 上均 <1.5×。这是 worst tier 的 decisive evidence。\"\n\n  - name: \"gpqa_ds_random_s030\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_random_s030_planned\"\n    description: \"GPQA random masking s=0.30, DeepSeek (needed for full picture)\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      high_median_ii: 0.12\n      mid_median_ii: 0.85\n      low_median_ii: 1.74\n      median_diff_low_minus_high: 1.620\n      wilcoxon_p: 7.8e-20\n      cohens_dz: 0.53\n      ci_low: 1.15\n      ci_high: 2.18\n      monotonic: true\n      imp_rand_ratio_s030: 1.21\n      random_also_non_monotonic: true\n      random_rho: 0.8\n    result_rationale: \"Random 在 s030 同样出现增长放缓 (s025 1.89 → s030 1.62, growth factor 0.86×)，与 importance 的 non-monotonicity 平行。这进一步确认：non-monotonicity 不是 importance-specific behavior 而是 GPQA + extreme sparsity 的 ceiling/collapse effect。两种 strategy 的 phase gradient 同步衰减表明驱动因素是 task-level 的 (reasoning chain 在 extreme compound sparsity 下崩溃导致 phase structure 本身消失)，而非 strategy-level 的。imp/rand ratio 在 s030 降至最低 (1.21×)——strategy 完全不可区分。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"GPQA Random Full Dose-Response\"\n        columns: [\"sparsity\", \"median_diff\", \"dz\", \"p\", \"monotonic_cumulative\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"s015\", 0.705, 0.52, \"8.3e-16\", \"yes\"]\n          - [\"s020\", 1.392, 0.58, \"5.2e-22\", \"yes\"]\n          - [\"s025\", 1.885, 0.62, \"1.1e-26\", \"yes\"]\n          - [\"s030\", 1.620, 0.53, \"7.8e-20\", \"NON-MONOTONIC (peak at s025)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Overlay plot: GPQA importance 和 random dose-response 曲线几乎完全重合，两者都在 s025 reach peak 后在 s030 回落\"\n    analysis: \"Random 和 importance 的 parallel non-monotonicity 是 worst tier 最强证据——任何基于 'strategy-specific' 的 narrative 都无法解释为什么两种完全不同的 eviction 方法产生相同的 dose-response shape。\"\n\n  - name: \"cross_benchmark_strategy_specificity_synthesis\"\n    plan_id: \"synthesis_analysis\"\n    description: \"综合分析：跨 4 benchmarks × 3 models 的 strategy specificity 汇总\"\n    expected_results:\n      conditions_with_strong_specificity: 1  # only MATH-500 DeepSeek\n      conditions_with_moderate_specificity: 1  # GSM8K DeepSeek s025\n      conditions_with_weak_or_no_specificity: 5  # GSM8K rest, GPQA all, LLaMA all\n      cross_benchmark_gradient_correlation: 0.72\n      strategy_specificity_fraction: \"1/7 (14%)\"\n      expected_reviewer_avg_score: 2.8\n      novelty_score: 2.7\n    result_rationale: \"汇总所有条件后，'strategy-specific phase interaction' 仅在单一条件 (MATH-500 DeepSeek, 15-17×) 成立。其余 6/7 条件的 imp/rand ratio 均 ≤3.8×，其中 GPQA 全部 <1.5×。Reviewers 会合理质疑：如果核心 claim 仅在一个 (model, benchmark) pair 上强，这是 robust finding 还是 idiosyncratic artifact？cross_benchmark_gradient_correlation 0.72 表明 phase gradient 本身跨 benchmark 存在 (moderate correlation)，但 strategy modulation 不 generalizable。预期 reviewer scores: Novelty 2.7 (phase gradient universality 有一定新意但被视为 'obvious once you measure it')，Soundness 3.0 (统计严格)，Significance 2.5 (practical impact unclear without method paper)，Overall 2.8。\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Strategy Specificity Summary (All Conditions)\"\n        columns: [\"benchmark\", \"model\", \"best_sparsity_ratio\", \"classification\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MATH-500\", \"DeepSeek-7B\", \"15.5-16.6×\", \"STRONG\"]\n          - [\"MATH-500\", \"Qwen-7B (n=500)\", \"2.7×\", \"WEAK\"]\n          - [\"MATH-500\", \"LLaMA-8B (n=250)\", \"2.0-2.6×\", \"WEAK\"]\n          - [\"GSM8K\", \"DeepSeek-7B\", \"2.3-3.8×\", \"MODERATE-WEAK\"]\n          - [\"GSM8K\", \"Qwen-7B\", \"~2.5×\", \"WEAK\"]\n          - [\"GPQA\", \"DeepSeek-7B\", \"1.2-1.3×\", \"NONE\"]\n      - name: \"Revised Paper Claim Structure (Worst Tier)\"\n        columns: [\"claim\", \"status_revision\", \"note\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Phase gradient universality\", \"PRIMARY (upgraded)\", \"All strategies (except recency) show phase gradient on all benchmarks\"]\n          - [\"Strategy specificity\", \"SECONDARY (downgraded)\", \"Only MATH-500 DeepSeek; task/architecture dependent\"]\n          - [\"Recency as phase-robust control\", \"PRIMARY (retained)\", \"Still unique: only strategy with NS across all sparsities\"]\n          - [\"Discrimination collapse\", \"MECHANISM (retained)\", \"Explains why importance ≥ random even when ratio small\"]\n          - [\"Dose-response monotonicity\", \"QUALIFIED\", \"Holds for MATH-500/GSM8K; non-monotonic on GPQA at extreme sparsity\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Strategy specificity heatmap (benchmark × model): 颜色编码 imp/rand ratio。仅左上角一个 cell (MATH-500/DS) 为深色 (>10×)，其余浅色 (<4×)。GPQA row 全为最浅色 (<1.5×)\"\n      - \"Reframed narrative diagram: 'universal phase vulnerability' 为中心节点，'strategy modulation' 为弱 secondary edge，'recency immunity' 为 key exception\"\n    analysis: \"在 worst tier 下，论文需要完全重构。核心贡献变为：(1) 首次量化 compound sparsity 的 phase vulnerability 是 universal property (所有 non-recency strategy 在所有 benchmark 上均显示)，(2) recency 作为唯一 immune strategy 的 practical design implication，(3) strategy specificity 作为 task/architecture-dependent secondary phenomenon。Reviewer 预期反应：'interesting empirical observation but incremental—once you measure phase gradient for random you see it's not strategy-specific, so the whole discrimination collapse story becomes auxiliary rather than central。' Expected score ~2.8, borderline for EMNLP。需要加强 practical implication (e.g., phase-aware compression guideline) 来弥补 novelty 不足。\"\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"175b1f5d-2385-49b8-8bc0-0b39bb9f6581","total_cost_usd":0.7161715000000001,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":59092,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":11470,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":59092,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":11470,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":59092,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":59092},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":54056,"outputTokens":22,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.054166,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":11470,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":59092,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.6620055,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"5bdeed5e-2547-48a9-b15e-ba183349e8dd"}
